/-!
# Repaired matter first jet of the global spatial section

For the fixed P506/L0 source, the repaired section matter field has one
explicit global normal form:

```text
input matter
  + canonical time × repaired action response at matching spatial contact.
```

The response is generated by the repaired Dirac-dual action operator.  No
residual, sign, support, or target jet enters this file.
-/

